{#- Members copy of the public converter at /conversor-de-ritmo/.

    Two differences from the public version, both deliberate:
      pcDark   — brand-guidelines.md §7.1: members-area interactive tools are
                 dark. The page chrome is dark too, via the second stylesheet.
      pcCross  — false. The public page ends by sending the reader to the zones
                 calculator; a subscriber already has the whole library one click
                 away in the breadcrumb and does not need to be sold it.

    Load order matters and all three stylesheets are required: site.css, then
    pace-converter.css (the tool), then members-zones-calculator.css (the page
    around it). Dropping the middle one leaves the tool completely unstyled while
    every structural check still passes — that is how the zones page shipped
    broken for one build on August 13, 2026. -#}
